WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.249
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:05.948
Tiny Coders, video 4.

3
00:00:05.998 --> 00:00:08.390
Loops: do it again.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:14.260
A loop says do these steps more than once, without writing them again.

5
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.336
Writing draw a star five times is long.

6
00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:24.029
Saying repeat five times, draw a star, is a loop.

7
00:00:24.079 --> 00:00:26.520
Same result, clearer plan.

8
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:31.782
Loops shine when the same action runs many times.

9
00:00:31.832 --> 00:00:36.740
Writing your name once, or choosing a snack, is not a repeat.

10
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.587
Let us recap.

11
00:00:39.637 --> 00:00:43.123
A loop repeats a block of steps.

12
00:00:43.173 --> 00:00:46.217
It keeps instructions short.

13
00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.980
Next: If this, then that.
